---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于 · 闲敲棋子" description="关于我和这个博客">
  <Header />
  <main class="max-w-prose mx-auto px-6 py-12 flex-1 w-full">
    <h1 class="text-3xl mb-8">关于</h1>
    <article>
      <p>这里是一个安静写字的地方。</p>
      <p>记录技术探索、阅读笔记，和偶尔的随笔。</p>
      <p>写作是为了整理思绪，分享是为了意外相逢。</p>
    </article>
    <section class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-light-tan">
      <h2 class="text-xl mb-4">找到我</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 font-sans text-sm">
        <li>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/yourusername">@yourusername</a></li>
        <li>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
